@startuml credit-decision
' NON-COMPLIANT on purpose. Deliberate defects:
'   - "alt" with no condition: the designer guessed which branch approves (SEQ007)
'   - a typo, "Custmer", creates a second customer nobody declared (SEQ001, critical)
title Credit decision
footer owner: Retail Credit · CRD-101 CRD-104

actor Customer
participant CreditOfficer
participant RiskEngine <<service>>

Customer -> CreditOfficer : submitApplication()
CreditOfficer -> RiskEngine : scoreApplicant()
RiskEngine --> CreditOfficer : score
alt
  CreditOfficer -> Customer : approveCredit()
else
  CreditOfficer -> Custmer : rejectApplication()
end
@enduml
